      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَغْلَى</span></b>  <i>More,</i> or <i>most, high</i> [or <i>excessive</i>] in
price: hence the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْضَلُ الرِّقَابِ أَغْلَاهَا ثَمَنًا</span>
[<i>The most excellent of slaves is the highest thereof
in price</i>]. (Mgh.)

